\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces B11 safety against quantum key recovery (analytic). A delegated key is exposed for its lifetime $L$ plus $V_{\max }$. It is safe only if one Ed25519 key takes longer than $L+V_{\max }$ to break. Right axis: fleet certificate traffic at that $L$ ($E=500$, $T=1000$).}}{11}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:b11}{{6}{11}{B11 safety against quantum key recovery (analytic). A delegated key is exposed for its lifetime $L$ plus $\vmax $. It is safe only if one Ed25519 key takes longer than $L+\vmax $ to break. Right axis: fleet certificate traffic at that $L$ ($E=500$, $T=1000$)}{figure.6}{}}
